From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 16:18:04 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] GraphicContext: skip a repeated fullscreen video set

VideoPlayer sets fullscreen video before Configure, and the fullscreen
window sets it again when it opens at AV start. The second set
triggered a second resolution switch for the same stream while it
played.
---
 xbmc/windowing/GraphicContext.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/xbmc/windowing/GraphicContext.cpp b/xbmc/windowing/GraphicContext.cpp
--- a/xbmc/windowing/GraphicContext.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/windowing/GraphicContext.cpp
@@ -0,6 +0,10 @@
 {
   std::unique_lock lock(*this);
 
+  // the player sets fullscreen video before its window opens; the open must not switch again
+  if (bOnOff && m_bFullScreenVideo && m_bFullScreenRoot)
+    return;
+
   m_bFullScreenVideo = bOnOff;
 
   if (m_bFullScreenRoot)
